Monotonicity:-
# Monotonic Behaviour Kya Hota Hai Binary Search Mein? 📈
    Monotonicity ka matlab hota hai ek aisa behaviour jo ya toh hamesha badhta rahe (strictly increasing) ya hamesha
    ghat ta rahe (strictly decreasing), aur kabhi apna direction change na kare.

> Sorted Array: Binary search hamesha sorted array par lagta hai kyunki sorted array monotonic hota hai (jaise [1, 3, 5, 8, 12] hamesha badh rha hai).

> Decision Space: Binary Search on Answer ke context mein monotonicity ka matlab hota hai ki agar kisi value X ke liye aapka answer True (possible) hai,
    toh X se bade (ya chhote, depend karta hai problem par) saare values ke liye bhi answer True hoga.
    Isko hum [F, F, F, T, T, T] ya [T, T, T, F, F, F] ke search space se represent karte hain.

> Why is it important? Agar search space monotonic nahi hoga (jaise [F, T, F, T]),
    toh aap decision nahi le paayenge ki mid element ko check karne ke baad kis direction (left ya right) mein move karna hai.

EXAMPLE:-- Ek Simple Real-Life Example (Ghar Ke Rules) 🏠
    Maano aapke papa ne ek rule banaya: "Agar tum din mein $X$ ghante padhoge, toh main tumhe gaming console kharid ke dunga."
    Ab hum check karte hain alag-alag padhai ke ghanton par ki kya aapko console milega (True = Console milega, False = Console nahi milega):

Agar aap 1 ghanta padhte ho $\rightarrow$ Papa ne mana kar diya (False)

Agar aap 2 ghante padhte ho $\rightarrow$ Papa ne mana kar diya (False)

Agar aap 3 ghante padhte ho $\rightarrow$ Papa ne mana kar diya (False)

Agar aap 4 ghante padhte ho $\rightarrow$ Papa maan gaye! (True)

Ab common sense lagao:
Agar aap 5 ghante padhoge, toh kya papa console denge? Haan, bilkul denge! (Kyunki jab 4 ghante par de rahe hain, toh usse zyada padhne par toh khushi-khushi denge) $\rightarrow$ (True)
Agar aap 6 ghante padhoge, toh? True
Agar aap 24 ghante padhoge, toh? True
Agar hum isko ek line mein likhein (1 ghante se lekar 6 ghante tak):
[ 1 hr, 2 hr, 3 hr, 4 hr, 5 hr, 6 hr ]
[ F, F, F, T, T, T ]

Is pattern ko dhyaan se dekho: [F, F, F, T, T, T]
Ek baar jab True mil gaya, toh uske aage ke saare options True hi hain. Isiko bolte hain Monotonicity (Decision Space).

